($q$Sweets and dry-fruit box$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$A box of mithai or mixed dry fruits in a nice package. Everyone uses it, nothing is wasted, and it is easy to hand out at the exit.$q$, $q$🍬$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$wedding return gift sweets dry fruit box$q$, $q$[{"label": "Cost", "value": "Low to medium"}, {"label": "Waste", "value": "None"}]$q$, 1),
