($q$Diya, candle or decor set$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$A handmade diya, candle or small decor piece. Good-looking and light to carry. Pick something simple that fits most homes.$q$, $q$🪔$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$wedding return gift diya candle set$q$, $q$[{"label": "Cost", "value": "Low to medium"}]$q$, 4),
($q$Personalised keepsake$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$A small item with your names and the date: a coaster, notebook, keychain or magnet. Lovely as a memento, but some guests will not keep it.$q$, $q$💌$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$personalised wedding return gift names date$q$, $q$[{"label": "Cost", "value": "Low to medium"}, {"label": "Lead time", "value": "Order early"}]$q$, 5),
($q$Tote bag with local snacks$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$A cloth bag with a few snacks from Delhi or Kolkata. Useful, light, and it ties in with where you come from.$q$, $q$👜$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$wedding return gift tote bag snacks hamper$q$, $q$[{"label": "Cost", "value": "Medium"}]$q$, 6),
($q$Donation in the guests' name$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$Instead of a gift, a donation to a cause and a small card telling guests about it. Nothing to carry or waste, but some guests like to receive something in hand.$q$, $q$🤝$q$, $q$Return gift$q$, $q$wedding favour donation in guests name card$q$, $q$[{"label": "Cost", "value": "You choose"}, {"label": "Waste", "value": "None"}]$q$, 7),
($q$Room welcome hamper$q$, $q$Welcome gift$q$, $q$A small basket in out-of-town guests' rooms: water, snacks, a schedule card and a map. Helpful at a new property like Hotel Sai. Ask the hotel what they allow and what they charge.$q$, $q$🧺$q$, $q$Welcome gift$q$, $q$wedding welcome hamper hotel room guests$q$, $q$[{"label": "For", "value": "Out-of-town guests"}, {"label": "Check", "value": "Hotel rules and charges"}]$q$, 8),
($q$Printed schedule and map card$q$, $q$Welcome gift$q$, $q$A one-page card with the function times (14 and 15 Feb), venue directions and a contact number. Costs almost nothing and saves a lot of calls.$q$, $q$🗺️$q$, $q$Welcome gift$q$, $q$wedding welcome card schedule itinerary$q$, $q$[{"label": "Cost", "value": "Very low"}]$q$, 9),
($q$Saree or shawl for the mothers$q$, $q$Family gift$q$, $q$A good saree, shawl or stole for each mother. A traditional way to thank them, and a gift they will keep. Ask what they like before you buy.$q$, $q$🧣$q$, $q$Family gift$q$, $q$gift for mother of bride groom saree shawl wedding$q$, $q$[{"label": "For", "value": "Mothers"}]$q$, 10),
