($q$Framed family photo$q$, $q$Family gift$q$, $q$A good framed family photograph from the wedding, delivered after the album is ready. Personal and timeless, but it comes after the wedding.$q$, $q$🖼️$q$, $q$Family gift$q$, $q$framed family photo gift wedding parents$q$, $q$[{"label": "Timing", "value": "After the wedding"}]$q$, 12),
($q$Gifts for siblings and cousins$q$, $q$Family gift$q$, $q$A matching small gift for each sibling and cousin who helps: a watch, a perfume, or something from their wish list. Ask the family group for ideas (this is still open in the planner).$q$, $q$🎀$q$, $q$Family gift$q$, $q$gift for sibling cousin wedding helpers$q$, $q$[{"label": "Planner", "value": "Family gift ideas: asked, not yet answered"}]$q$, 13),
