($q$Couple dance: romantic and slow$q$, $q$Couple dance$q$, $q$A slow, romantic number, with simple steps and a few lifts or spins. Easiest to learn and the most emotional on the night.$q$, $q$💞$q$, $q$Couple dance$q$, $q$romantic couple dance sangeet choreography slow$q$, $q$[{"label": "Difficulty", "value": "Easy"}]$q$, 1),
